  "implementation": [
    "Defer codec replacement close publication until the new confirmed binding has actual direction-appropriate flow. Preserve the first observed old retirement time independently of publication time.",
    "Publish ordinary closed/opened wire envelopes as one sealed native lifecycle batch. Apply announcement state only after whole-batch local write completion; HTTP, journal and generic command replies gain no such batch capability.",
    "Hold the exact physical writer/source guard across both frames; interruption after touched IO retires the physical stream before guard release. Local submission is not peer receipt."
  ],
